<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "Grants voice to a user (prefix +), allowing them to speak in moderated (+m) channels. Half-operators and above can grant voice."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_channels", "When to use it")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "Give voice to the guests of a talk, the people asking questions, or trusted regulars. In a moderated channel they can speak while everyone else listens. Voice gives no other power. A voiced user cannot kick, ban or change modes."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_terminal}>{dgettext("help_channels", "Usage")}</.help_h4>
<pre>/mode +v Alice  {dgettext("help_channels", "Give voice to Alice")}
/mode -v Alice  {dgettext("help_channels", "Remove voice from Alice")}
/voice Alice    {dgettext("help_channels", "Give voice to Alice")}
/devoice Alice  {dgettext("help_channels", "Remove voice from Alice")}</pre>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "The command changes the channel you are looking at. You do not type the channel name."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_channels", "How it works")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "The person must be in the channel. Otherwise the command fails with an error."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "Voiced users are marked with a voice icon in the user list."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "Each member holds one rank at a time. Voice sits above regular members and below half-operators."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "Voice given with this command lasts while the person stays in the channel. It is not kept when they leave."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "In a registered channel, add people to the ChanServ voice list to give them voice each time they join."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_channels", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="mode-m">{dgettext("help_channels", "Moderated (+m)")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="mode-h">{dgettext("help_channels", "Half-Operator (+h)")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-voice">/voice</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-devoice">/devoice</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="chanserv-access">{dgettext("help_channels", "Access Lists")}</.help_link>
</p>
